      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2007-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(3\\star 5=(3+5)\\cdot 5=40\\) and \\(5\\star 3=(5+3)\\cdot 3=24,\\) the difference is \\(40-24=16.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
